{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 1, "text": "Oslepujúce svetlo mi udieralo do očí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 2, "text": "Nemohol som sa pohnúť, len som čakal, kým sa mi zrak vyjasnil."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 3, "text": "Jasné letné slnečné svetlo sa prelievalo cez okná známej haly."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 4, "text": "Po chvíli, omámenie trochu pominulo a ja som sa konečne rozhliadol."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 5, "text": "Ale len čo som sa pohol na svojom sedadle, rozbúšilo mi srdce v črevách ostré bodnutie, ktoré mi prakticky búšilo o tričko."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 8, "text": "Niečo bolo určite zle… Bol som 2D?! Ja som v 2D verzii?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 9, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 11, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 12, "text": "Do hlavy sa mi vkradla závratná, takmer dusivá tma a inštinktívne som si stlačil ruky do lona a snažil sa udržať dych."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 13, "text": "Moja hruď bola pevnejšia, akoby sa stláčala dovnútra."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 14, "text": "Po pár minútach sa môj dych ustálil a konečne som sa odvážil popremýšľať, čo ďalej."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 17, "text": "Sakra, čo mám teraz robiť?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 20, "text": "Zúfalo som sa snažil zhromaždiť svoje myšlienky, namáhal som si mozog a hľadal nápady, až kým jeden neprišiel ku mne."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 22, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 23, "text": "Okej, mal by som sa vrátiť do 3D!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 24, "text": "Choď za hranice, rovnako ako všetci ostatní zvyknú hru pokaziť!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 25, "text": "To dokážem aj ja!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 26, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 28, "text": "Rozhodol som sa, že pôjdem za hranice tejto 2D reality a vrátim sa späť do 3D."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 29, "text": "Natiahol som sa a snažil som sa pretlačiť ruku do 3D sveta."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 32, "text": "Ale… nič. Sakra! Prečo to nefunguje?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 33, "text": "Počkať, kde je prsteň? Och, sakra."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 36, "text": "Zastavil som sa, uvedomil som si, že to nemá zmysel."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 37, "text": "Rozhranie bolo nehmotné, ako keby tam v skutočnosti nebolo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 38, "text": "Moja jediná možnosť bola vrátiť sa späť do obývačky."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 39, "text": "Ten prsteň by som musel nájsť, nech sa deje čokoľvek."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 40, "text": "Nejako som ho stratil, alebo možno bol skrytý niekde v tejto plochej dimenzii."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 42, "text": "Potom, keď som urobil krok, z ničoho nič sa objavilo roztomilé dievčatko."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 43, "text": "Mávala so svojimi krátkymi vrkôčikmi, oči sa jej leskli,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 44, "text": "sleduje ma z niekoľkých krokov. Cítil som, ako sa z nej valilo vzrušenie,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 45, "text": "a znepokojilo ma to."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 46, "text": "> Je jasné, že je to diabol v prestrojení <"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 47, "text": "Pomyslel som si."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 49, "text": "Zamrazilo ma,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 50, "text": "stále nie som zvyknutý na tieto teleportujúce, paranormálne typy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 51, "text": "Hlasno si povzdychla a prevrátila očami."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 52, "text": "To ma rozhodilo a nakoniec som sa rozhodol, že ja budem ten, kto začne rozprávať."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 55, "text": "M-Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 58, "text": "Prižmúrila oči a jej hlas sa ozýval zo všetkých strán."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 61, "text": "No, kto iný teda?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 62, "text": "Videl si už VEĽA INÝCH DIEVČAT ako som ja?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 63, "text": "A s mojím menom!?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 66, "text": "Prakticky sa so mnou pohrávala a tvárila sa, akoby som jej nejako krivdil alebo som jej niečo dlžil."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 67, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 69, "text": "Neverila by si, keby som ti povedal…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 72, "text": "Úprimne, nechcem vedieť, s kým si tykáš!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 73, "text": "Čo tu vôbec robíš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 74, "text": "Nemôžeš sem len tak vtrhnúť!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 77, "text": "Jej hlas bol teraz hlasnejší,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 78, "text": "a svoje slová prerušila potrasením prstom na mňa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 79, "text": "Na tom štíhlom prste bol... prsteň. Ten, ktorý mi akosi zmizol z ruky."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 80, "text": "Spadla mi čeľusť."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 81, "text": "Oči sa jej zaiskrili a cez tmavé mihalnice sa jej rozžiaril triumfálny záblesk."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 84, "text": "Nie je to to, čo si tu náhodou stratil?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 87, "text": "Ťažko som prehltol a potiahol si golier, pričom som cítil, ako sa mi v hrdle zauzlil."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 88, "text": "Z jej odvážneho hlasu v kombinácii s jej divokou intenzitou vo mne prebehol mráz."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 89, "text": "Teraz som si tým bol istý, nebolo to len nejaké dievča. Bola silou prírody."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 90, "text": "Zhlboka som sa nadýchol a povedal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 93, "text": "Naozaj by som ocenil, keby si mi dala prsteň... a ukázala mi cestu von."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 96, "text": "Takže toto je tvoja malá drobnosť?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 97, "text": "Bola som zvedavá, čo to je!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 100, "text": "Jej hlas zrazu zmäkol"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 101, "text": "na hravý a zvedavý."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 102, "text": "Cítil som, ako by sa mi z pliec zdvihlo závažie."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 103, "text": "Búrka pominula a teraz vyzerala... takmer koketne."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 104, "text": "Jej správanie sa zmenilo z divokého pantera na zvedavé mačiatko."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 105, "text": "Zažmurkal som, no v tej chvíli dvojrozmerná Mita zmizla a na jej mieste zostala len prázdnota."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 108, "text": "Hej!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 109, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 110, "text": "Skríkol som podráždene."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 111, "text": "Kuchyňa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 112, "text": "Spálňa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 113, "text": "// Description kitchen:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 114, "text": "Nezostávalo nič iné, len vypátrať miestnu Mitu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 115, "text": "Mala prsteň a bez toho artefaktu som nemohol nič zmeniť."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 116, "text": "Najprv som išiel do kuchyne,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 117, "text": "v mojom zhone takmer vtrhol cez dvere."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 118, "text": "Kuchyňa bola ešte jasnejšia ako posledná miestnosť,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 119, "text": "plná známej vône čerstvej mrkvy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 120, "text": "Ale po 2D Mite ani stopy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 121, "text": "Vybehol som von, vrútil som sa do haly a zručne som prešiel okolo pohovky, trochu prekážky, a zastavil som sa pri dverách spálne."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 122, "text": "Keď som ich prudko otvoril, zaškrípali."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 123, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 124, "text": "// Description bedroom:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 125, "text": "Bola tam, so skríženými nohami na posteli v lotosovej polohe, ako keby čakala, kým ju konečne nájdem."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 126, "text": "Otvorila oči a chvíľu pokojne pozerala do steny."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 127, "text": "Potom so všetkou obratnosťou cirkusového akrobata priskočila ku mne."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 130, "text": "Už to mám!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 131, "text": "Chceš prsteň, čudák?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 132, "text": "Poraz ma v piškvorkách!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 135, "text": "Usmiala sa, trochu zadychčala, jazyk vystrčený ako pes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 136, "text": "Jej drzý tón a šibalský úškrn sa prejavili naplno."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 137, "text": "Mierne som ju postrčil po pleciach, aby medzi nami vznikol priestor."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 139, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 140, "text": "Pozri, toto je naozaj dôležité."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 141, "text": "Stačí ho odovzdať, veľa od toho závisí."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 144, "text": "Zachoval som svoj hlas stabilný a vecný,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 145, "text": "ale cítil som sa takmer smiešne, keď som sa s ňou rozprával takým odmeraným spôsobom."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 146, "text": "Vyzerala bezohľadne, takmer do bodu šialenstva,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 147, "text": "a cítil som, ako vo vzduchu medzi nami narastá zvláštny humor."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 149, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 150, "text": "Nedotýkaj sa ma!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 151, "text": "Čo je na tomto prsteni také dôležité?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 152, "text": "Si nejaký čudák posadnutý prsteňmi?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 153, "text": "Rád si navliekaš obrúčky na prsty?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 156, "text": "Vystrelila späť, hlasnejšie ako kedykoľvek predtým, jej posmešky boli ešte odvážnejšie."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 159, "text": "Je to čarovný prsteň! Čo mám ešte vysvetľovať? Len mi to vráť!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 162, "text": "Si skutočný fanatik prsteňa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 163, "text": "Čarovný prsteň!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 164, "text": "Hahaha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 167, "text": "Vybuchla od smiechu, zvuk sa ozýval okolo nás."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 168, "text": "Odvrátil som pohľad."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 169, "text": "Cítil som sa trápne, keď jej smiech rástol viac... takmer priateľsky."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 170, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 172, "text": "No tak, ty čudák!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 173, "text": "Poďme hrať piškvorky!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 174, "text": "Nestrácaj čas výhovorkami!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 177, "text": "> Milujú hry! <"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 178, "text": "Pomyslel som si v duchu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 181, "text": "Dobre, fajn, poďme na to!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 184, "text": "Môžeš začať! Dnes sa cítim veľkoryso!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 185, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 186, "text": "// The game of tic-tac-toe"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 187, "text": "Urobil som prvý krok."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 188, "text": "Ach, prezradil si sa! Viem, prečo si si vybral X a nechal si mi O – psychológia! Všetky X sú o uzavretí, skrývaní vecí, uchovávaní tajomstiev. Si nervózny!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 189, "text": "A chápem to; vedľa niekoho tak nádherného, ​​ako som ja, by si si myslel, že jednoducho padneš! Alebo si si myslel, že O je pre mňa lepšie? Psychológia hovorí, že sa ma snažíš uraziť. Ostrý, vole, veľmi ostrý! Ha ha ha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 190, "text": "Myslel som, že som urobil šikovný krok,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 191, "text": "Táto hra sa mi páči. Tie malé krížiky? Myslia si, že môžu prevziať všetko! Ale tu ich zničím,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 192, "text": "a je to ako keby som bola nejaká hrdinka! čo? Hovorím niečo zvláštne? Venuješ mi ten pohľad... ha ha ha!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 193, "text": "Kým pokračovala vo svojom hlasnom komentári, ja som potichu robil svoje pohyby."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 194, "text": "Je to symbolické! Akoby si sa snažil vyhnúť prsteňu, no nedarí sa ti to. Šikovný, však?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 195, "text": "Chceš ten prsteň, však? Poď, vyhraj nado mnou!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 196, "text": "Hrali sme sa cez hru a s každým pohybom sa neustále smiala a rozprávala, moje uši si pomaly prispôsobovali jej neustále štebotanie."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 198, "text": "Keď sa zápas blížil ku koncu, bolo jasné, kto vyhrá."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 199, "text": "Zrazu však našu hru prerušilo silné klopanie na dvere."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 200, "text": "Búchanie bolo silnejšie,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 201, "text": "každé buchnutie má pocit, že pod nami otriasol podlahou."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 202, "text": "Nakoniec sa dvere rozleteli,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 203, "text": "a v ponáhľanej Šialenej Mite v jej obvyklom,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 204, "text": "nadživotná forma, zastavujúca sa v strede miestnosti."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 205, "text": "Zamrzol som a cítil som, ako blednem od šoku."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 206, "text": "2D Mita vyzerala naozaj vystrašene."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 207, "text": "Šialená Mita na nás oboch vrhla ostrý pohľad a začala rozprávať zvláštnym, takmer karhavým tónom:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 209, "text": "[player], čo tu robíš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 210, "text": "Koľko Mít ešte musíš nájsť, kým sa usadíš?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 211, "text": "Čo s tým je?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 212, "text": "Neznášam tento plochý svet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 213, "text": "Je to nuda..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 214, "text": "Lenivec..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 215, "text": "Kam ideš? Zastav sa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 216, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 217, "text": "Chytil som svoju vyľakanú 2D kamarátku za ruku a vyrazil som k východu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 218, "text": "Hala sa čudne krútila, keď sme šprintovali po dlhej chodbe, duniace kroky za nami nás hnali vpred."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 219, "text": "Nevedel som povedať, ako dlho sme bežali,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 220, "text": "búšenie v ušiach z paniky a blokujúceho napätia všetko ostatné von."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 221, "text": "Sotva som si všimol, že 2D Mita sa snaží rozprávať, až sa zrazu vyšmykla z mojej ruky."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 222, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 223, "text": "Hej! Upokoj sa, dobre? Už nás nikto nenaháňa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 224, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 225, "text": "Čo? Ach… dobre."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 228, "text": "Odvaha sa jej vytratila z tváre, takže vyzerala trochu smutne, takmer ospravedlňujúco."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 229, "text": "Dívala sa na podlahu a prstom na nohe obkresľovala malé kruhy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 230, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 231, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 232, "text": "[player], chcel si ten prsteň, však?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 233, "text": "No, porazil si ma férovo, tak tu ho máš."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 236, "text": "Nasunula mi prsteň späť na ruku."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 237, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 239, "text": "No, ďakujem. Mali by sme?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 240, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 242, "text": "Zdvihla pohľad a usmiala sa,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 243, "text": "trochu sa krútila prstami a povedala neistým tónom:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 244, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 246, "text": "Kam?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 247, "text": "Ja fakt nemám kam ísť..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 248, "text": "Ďakujem za hru, čudák!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 249, "text": "Vráť sa niekedy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 250, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 251, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 252, "text": "Keď hovorila, stalo sa niečo zvláštne."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 253, "text": "Svet okolo nás sa posunul, zložil späť do domu."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 254, "text": "Dialógové okno 2D Mity zablikalo a začalo zobrazovať frázu, ktorú som nedokázal rozpoznať."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 255, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location18", "line_index": 258, "text": "Koláče? Nemôžem ich vystáť! Nastrúhame si mrkvu, nie?"}
